{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32519","headline":"桑妇 · 刘驾","name":"桑妇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"墙下桑叶尽，春蚕半未老。\n城南路迢迢，今日起更早。\n四邻无去伴，醉卧青楼晓。\n妾颜不如谁，所贵守妇道。\n一春常在树，自觉身如鸟。\n归来见小姑，新妆弄百草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}